# Docs

Write new notes in Brazilian Portuguese under `docs/sprint-N/`, with the header shape of `docs/sprint-1/requisitos-do-fluxo.md`.

Record the command output from the run, including an empty transcript and the error text. Leave a closed sprint file unchanged, including a failed recognition.
